      "finding": "HGM bridge payloads currently carry content_summary strings and metadata, while QDT/WM SystemWriteProposal requires a finite torch.Tensor content vector with a configured dimension.",
      "id": "HGM-QDT-R1",
      "impact": "No safe write-stage adapter can construct a real commit proposal without an explicit vector/tensor materialization contract.",
