      "id": "HGM-QDT-R2",
      "impact": "Direct commit would create mismatched or duplicated slot identities.",
      "mitigation": "Add a canonical-slot mapping adapter that treats HGM target_slot_id as local_slot_id and lets WM generate css-* canonical IDs, then records both IDs in lineage.",
